tps://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12769551012,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVQrvmM8AAAAC-R_ipA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/labels/%E5%BE%AE%E5%8D%9A%E5%8F%8D%E9%A6%88","name":"微博反馈","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"从微博评论整理，待维护者决定是否做","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-20T16:50:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:00:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-21T03:45:31Z","assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> 来源：2026-10-20/21 微博评论整理。待维护者决定是否做。和 #1、#17 相关，维护者已回复「正在做 4K 的适配」。\n\n## 反馈\n\n- 「UI 是 4K 的吗？」「主界面能不能提升到 4K60」。\n- 4K 电视上：「agent 提示词写得好，就是图标分辨率在 4K 上有点模糊」。\n- 雷鸟鹏 6SE：桌面图标很糊。系统 UI 是 720p 拉伸的，默认图标又小，放大后就糊了。\n- 自己上传的壁纸：照片分辨率比屏幕高，但看上去是糊的。\n\n## 要查\n\n- 各台电视 UI 实际渲染的分辨率：很多 4K 电视的 UI 层是 1080p，甚至 720p。`Wallpapers.screenW/H` 取的是哪个值？\n- 上传的照片在 `Wallpapers.kt` 里被缩到最长边 2560 px 并存成 JPEG 90，主页再按 `screenW×screenH` 裁剪，还要叠 `shadeForHome`。糊是出在上传这一步（手机页面有没有先压缩），还是在显示这一步？\n- 应用图标：取 App 里最高 density 的图标资源（Android 8 以上走 AdaptiveIcon）。对只带 `xhdpi` 图标的国产 App，拿不到更清楚的，只能靠 #1 重绘。\n\n工作量：中，需要分别查清楚各台的渲染分辨率。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/30/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/30/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/comments/6309216417","html_url":"https://github.com/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/30#issuecomment-6309216417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/30","id":6309216417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOVQrvmM8AAAABeA8AoQ","user":{"login":"pengchujin","id":16513318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTEzMzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16513318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin","html_url":"https://github.com/pengchujin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T06:00:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:00:20Z","body":"微博新反馈（2026-10-21）：一位 85 寸电视用户说「清晰度差了点」，没说版本和是哪部分（磁贴、壁纸还是屏保）。1.15 已经按实际像素生成磁贴和壁纸；如果 1.15 上还是糊，欢迎在这里补充截图和机型。","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/comments/6309216417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-21T06:00:20Z"},{"id":"17782106288","type":"IssueCommentEvent","actor":{"id":16513318,"login":"pengchujin","display_login":"pengchujin","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16513318?"},"repo":{"id":1426780056,"name":"pengchujin/aerial-tv","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv"},"payload":{"action":"created","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31","id":5945823248,"node_id":"I_kwDOVQrvmM8AAAABYmYQEA","number":31,"title":"install.sh 支持 Android 11 以上的无线调试配对（TCL Q9M、Q10L 等）","user":{"login":"pengchujin","id":16513318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTEzMzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16513318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin","html_url":"https://github.com/pengchujin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12764177394,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVQrvmM8AAAAC-M3j8g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12769551012,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVQrvmM8AAAAC-R_ipA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/labels/%E5%BE%AE%E5%8D%9A%E5%8F%8D%E9%A6%88","name":"微博反馈","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"从微博评论整理，待维护者决定是否做","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-20T16:50:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:00:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> 来源：2026-10-20/21 微博评论整理。待维护者决定是否做。\n\n## 反馈\n\n- TCL Q9M Pro：「卡在 ADB 了，AI 说要配对码」。\n- TCL Q10L：「ADB 开了，但端口是动态的不是 5555，TLS 握手一直被拒绝，Agent 搞了一个多小时」。\n- 一位用户最后**用数据线连电脑**，让 AI 打开了 5555 端口才连上。\n- 小米澎湃 OS 4（两人）：电脑连不上 ADB。\n\n这是 Android 11 以上的「无线调试」：要先 `adb pair <ip>:<配对端口> <配对码>`，再 `adb connect <ip>:<连接端口>`，连接端口每次都会变。\n\n## 建议\n\n- `tools/install.sh` 识别这种情况：连 5555 失败时，提示用户在电视上打开「无线调试 → 使用配对码配对」，把屏幕上的 IP:端口和 6 位配对码填进来，脚本执行 `adb pair` 和 `adb connect`。\n- 连上以后执行 `adb tcpip 5555`（脚本已经有 `KEEP_ADB`），以后就不用再配对。\n- 把这段写进官网的 agent 提示词，让 AI 遇到时知道怎么做。\n\n工作量：小到中。需要一台 Android 11 以上、带无线调试的电视来验证（TCL Q9M/Q10L 这类）。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/comments/6309215668","html_url":"https://github.com/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31#issuecomment-6309215668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pengchujin/aerial-tv/issues/31","id":6309215668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOVQrvmM8AAAABeA79tA","user":{"login":"pengchujin","id":16513318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTEzMzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16513318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pengchujin","html_url":"https://github.com/pengchujin","followers_